# Keep the build context small and secret-free.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/*.env.example
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
.agents
.claude
.codestudio
.hermes
assets
docs
devops/backup
!devops/backup/*.sh
devops/env/*.env
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
docker-compose*.yml
e2e
devops/nginx
devops/proxy
devops/scripts
devops/postgres
**/*.md
